WEBVTT

00:05:28.454 --> 00:05:33.538
that this might be one of the exceptions
in which it actually might be rational

00:05:33.538 --> 00:05:35.413
to invest more in the situation.

00:05:37.579 --> 00:05:40.454
If this can happen to an expert
on escalation of commitment,

00:05:40.871 --> 00:05:42.496
what hope is there for the rest of us?

00:05:43.913 --> 00:05:46.538
I'm painfully familiar with
this phenomenon myself,

00:05:47.079 --> 00:05:49.788
like the time I wrote a whole book
instead of a book proposal

00:05:50.204 --> 00:05:54.996
and had to throw away over 100000 words
and start over or the time.

00:05:54.996 --> 00:05:58.829
I spent months trying to change the
behavior of a toxic team member when

00:05:58.829 --> 00:06:03.579
I should have just let him go. Escalation
of commitment happens in every workplace.